  - FDR threshold: ', fdr_t, '
  - |logFC| threshold: ', logfc_t, '
  
  ## Volcano Plot
  
  ![](volcano_plot.png)
  
  ## Top Significant Genes
  
  ')
  
  write(rmd_content, "report.Rmd")
  rmarkdown::render("report.Rmd", output_file="biomarker_report.html", quiet=TRUE)
  cat("BIOMARKER_REPORT live: biomarker_report.html\n")
  REOF
